                  influence of pollutants and sea ice decline on lipid
                  metabolism in polar bears},
  author       = {Tartu, Sabrina and Lille-Langøy, Roger and Størseth, Trond R
                  and Bourgeon, Sophie and Brunsvik, Anders and Aars, Jon and
