  doi          = {10.1101/2020.05.29.124396},
  abstract     = {AbstractDisease susceptibility and resistance comprise
                  important factors in conservation, particularly in elephants.
                  To determine genetic mechanisms underlying disease resistance
                  and other unique elephant traits, we estimated 862 and 1,017
                  potential regulatory elements in Asian and African elephants,
                  respectively. These elements are significantly enriched in
