                  thereby con- trasting with the strict insectivory
                  characterizing primitive bats found in other continents in the
                  same epoch.},
  urldate      = {2024-10-10},
  keywords     = {Early Eocene; Chambi; Witwatia; Chiroptera; Vespertilionoidea
                  Philisidae; Africa},
  language     = {en}
