  doi          = {10.1111/evo.12197},
  abstract     = {Cetaceans rival primates in brain size relative to body size
                  and include species with the largest brains and biggest bodies
                  to have ever evolved. Cetaceans are remarkably diverse,
                  varying in both phenotypes by several orders of magnitude,
                  with notable differences between the two extant suborders,
