  abstract     = {In addition to viral infections, malignant disorders,
                  autoimmune diseases, and allograft rejection episodes,
                  neopterin increases in older people where it is found to be
                  predictive of overall mortality. Thus, the serum
                  concentrations of this biomarker of systemic immune and
                  inflammation activation, were measured in a small cohort of
                  Sardinian middle-aged, older adults and centenarians. There
                  was a significant positive correlation between neopterin
