                  a specialized laboratory. Here, we present a protocol to
                  genetically identify nematodes using 18S SSU rRNA sequencing
                  using the MinION, a portable third generation sequencer, and
                  proof that it is possible to perform all the molecular
                  preparations on a fully portable molecular biology lab – the
