  doi          = {10.1186/s12864-024-11068-6},
  abstract     = {BACKGROUND: Genomic instability and evading apoptosis are two
                  fundamental hallmarks of cancer and closely linked to DNA
                  damage response (DDR). By analyzing expression quantitative
                  trait loci (eQTL) upon cell stimulation (called exposure eQTL
                  (e2QTL)) it is possible to identify context specific gene
