                  isolate CD8+ T cells from 461 healthy donors and stimulate
                  them with high doses of 5 different carcinogens to identify
                  regulatory mechanisms of DNA damage-induced apoptosis. Across
                  all stimuli, we find 5,373 genes to be differentially
