                  organisms, which remains very difficult to determine. Here, we
                  present data on somatic mutation rates in mice and humans,
                  obtained by sequencing single cells and clones derived from
                  primary fibroblasts, which allows us to make the first direct
                  comparison with germline mutation rates in these two species.
