                  include cardiovascular diseases [CVDs], chronic obstructive
                  pulmonary disease, chronic kidney disease, neurodegenerative
                  diseases and cancer. OS, induced by ROS, is neutralized by
                  different enzymatic and non-enzymatic antioxidants and
                  prevents cells, tissues and organs from damage. However,
                  prolonged OS decreases the content of antioxidant status of
                  cells by reducing the activities of reductants and
