                  perturbations. We addressed this challenge by profiling
                  transcriptional, translational, and posttranslational
                  reporters using CRISPR interference (CRISPRi) with barcoded
                  expression reporter sequencing (CiBER-seq). Our barcoding
                  approach allowed us to connect an entire library of guides to
                  their individual phenotypic consequences using pooled
                  sequencing. CiBER-seq profiling fully recapitulated the
                  integrated stress response (ISR) pathway in yeast. Genetic
                  perturbations causing uncharged transfer RNA (tRNA)
