                  Analyses}} of a {{Comprehensive Molecular Supermatrix}}},
  author       = {Amador, Lucila I and Moyers Arévalo, R Leticia and Almeida,
                  Francisca C and Catalano, Santiago A and Giannini, Norberto P},
  journaltitle = {Journal of mammalian evolution},
  volume       = {25},
  issue        = {1},
